WEBVTT

00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:17,100
In large adrenal gland remedies, if you have a large adrenal gland, you want to find out

00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,100
why.

00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:23,100
So that is not obviously normal.

00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:30,100
So if it wasn't diagnosed through an ultrasound, as being one of them was larger than the other,

00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:32,100
you'd want to figure out why.

00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:41,100
Normally, you don't have an enlarged adrenal gland.

00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:49,100
A person can be very normal to have an enlarged heart because that person was an athlete or something as a youth.

00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:52,100
And you can have issues with that.

00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:58,100
But in a large adrenal gland, you'd want to do some more investigation.

